# Private identity replay data -- household images/video, embeddings, populated
# manifests, and generated reports must never be committed.
# Committed: schema/example/harness only (see tests/private_identity_replay/).
tracking-orchestrator/tests/private_identity_replay/data/
**/*.households.json
tracking-orchestrator/tests/private_identity_replay/**/manifest.json
!tracking-orchestrator/tests/private_identity_replay/example/manifest.json
tracking-orchestrator/tests/private_identity_replay/**/*.jpg
